# twinsanityevolved padlog v1 -- pad 0 per frame boundary: BOUNDARY BUTTONS(wire order, hex) LX LY RX RY  # names
# Ice Climb's stream of floating ice (levels\ice\iceclimb\caveent): LOAD GAME on a card whose save starts that chunk
# (tools/warp_save.py --chunk 'levels\ice\iceclimb\caveent' --place 0xFFFF on the hub card hub_entry.padlog writes by 2700),
# CROSS on the autosave notice, walk to the stream, land on the first berg and stand on it 8 s (it settles 1.1 lower under
# Crash), cross the other three, stand on the far bank, turn the camera back to the stream (right stick right 70) and wait
# while the bergs are put back at their floating height. Recorded from iceclimb_bergs.plan by the autopilot; the
# iceclimb_bergs judge replays it to 4412 (a bat reaches Crash on the far bank at 4420).
